sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant H as Host spot (flags page)
    participant S as messagingCtaLogic
    participant F as PostHog analytics
    participant D as Before you send
    participant E as Broadcast editor
    participant A as HogFlow API
    participant J as First real send task (daily)
    H->>S: mount MessagingCta(placement, context, audience)
    S->>F: peek holdout and area flag (local, no request)
    Note over H,S: spot first visible
    S->>F: exposure for holdout and area flag (every arm)
    alt not holdout and variant is this spot
        S->>S: mint attemptId
        S->>F: capture messaging cta shown {placement, variant, cta, attemptId}
        S-->>H: render button, menu item or toast with payload copy
    else control, holdout or another spot
        S-->>H: render nothing
    end
    H->>S: person clicks
    S->>F: capture message audience clicked {source, destination, placement, attemptId}
    S->>H: audience() (runs now, not at render)
    H-->>S: properties, trigger, source record
    S->>D: loadMessageAudienceWarnings
    D-->>S: none, or a note the person continues past
    S->>E: open editor URL with source and attempt
    E->>A: first save {entry_attempt_id}
    A->>F: hog_flow_created {hog_flow_id, entry_attempt_id}
    E->>A: launch or enable
    A->>F: hog_flow_activated {hog_flow_id, entry_attempt_id}
    J->>J: first billable email per workflow in app_metrics2
    J->>A: set first_real_send_at where it is null
    J->>F: workflow first real send {hog_flow_id, entry_attempt_id}, rows it updated only
